From: Yelpence TEKNOFEST 2026
Subject: Add /fmu/in/gps_inject_data to uXRCE-DDS bridge

PX4 v1.16'da uXRCE-DDS varsayilan kopru listesi /fmu/in/gps_inject_data
topic'ini icermiyor. Bu yama, ROS2 tarafindan yayinlanan RTCM duzeltme
verilerinin PX4 gps_inject_data uORB topic'ine ulasabilmesi icin yamayi
ekler.

Etkilenen modul: px4_bridge (RTK: RTCM3 framer + GpsInjectData yayini).
Yama uygulanmadan px4_bridge (RTK) calisir ancak PX4'e veri ulasmaz; SITL'de
sessiz hata uretir.

UYGULAMA:
  1. PX4-Autopilot calisma agacinda 'docker/patches/gps_inject_data_dds.patch'
     dosyasi git apply ile uygulanmalidir:
       cd src/px4_autopilot
       git apply ../../docker/patches/gps_inject_data_dds.patch
  2. uXRCE-DDS istemcisi yeniden derlenmelidir (px4_sitl_default).
  3. Yama firmware/build sahibinin onayinda uygulanir (RTK PR'inin
     parcasi DEGILDIR; ayri bir koordinasyon adimidir).

KAYNAKLAR:
- px4_msgs/msg/GpsInjectData.msg (timestamp, device_id, len, flags, data[300])
- src/drivers/gps/gps.cpp:210 — gps_inject_data subscription
- src/modules/mavlink/mavlink_receiver.cpp:2576 — referans enjeksiyon

DOGRULAMA:
  cd src/px4_autopilot
  git apply --check ../../docker/patches/gps_inject_data_dds.patch

diff --git a/src/modules/uxrce_dds_client/dds_topics.yaml b/src/modules/uxrce_dds_client/dds_topics.yaml
--- a/src/modules/uxrce_dds_client/dds_topics.yaml
+++ b/src/modules/uxrce_dds_client/dds_topics.yaml
@@ -163,5 +163,8 @@ subscriptions:
   - topic: /fmu/in/aux_global_position
     type: px4_msgs::msg::VehicleGlobalPosition

+  - topic: /fmu/in/gps_inject_data
+    type: px4_msgs::msg::GpsInjectData
+
 # Create uORB::PublicationMulti
 subscriptions_multi:
